%% title: Importing homework from a file
%% desc: Download the template, write one homework per row, and upload the file. The app checks every row. If any row has a problem, nothing is saved; fix the problem rows and upload again. If there are no problems, confirming creates all the homework at once.
flowchart TD
  D["Download<br/>template"]:::teacher --> F["Fill in rows"]:::teacher
  F --> U["Upload file"]:::teacher
  U --> V{"All rows OK?"}:::note
  V -->|"No"| X["Fix the<br/>problem rows"]:::note
  X --> U
  V -->|"Yes"| C["Confirm import"]:::teacher
  C --> R["All homework<br/>created"]:::note
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
